            "name": "Swim Meet",
            "steam_appid": 467740,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adult comedic visual novel story about a young mans attempt to return to the Swimming team he once left. Can he train and rejoin the team or will he let beautiful training partners distract him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467740/extras/d433242b21f1d69eb842ac813f18cac5.avif?t=1793816432\" width=620 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you will train with a random swimmer in order to grow stronger. But don't forget each woman may also be interested in having some other fun with you along the way. Choose when to enjoy their attention and when not to as you fixate on your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467740/extras/1ccffc21e481d34540c17203cba12931.avif?t=1793816432\" width=620 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you will interact with the female swimmers and make decisions that will determine if you will get some steamy events or end up needing a cold shower. Do well enough and surely a place on the team is assured!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467740/extras/1383849f948b4ce19bd1646914acc537.avif?t=1793816432\" width=620 height=265 /></span></h2>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adult comedic visual novel story about a young mans attempt to return to the Swimming team he once left. Can he train and rejoin the team or will he let beautiful training partners distract him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467740/extras/d433242b21f1d69eb842ac813f18cac5.avif?t=1793816432\" width=620 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you will train with a random swimmer in order to grow stronger. But don't forget each woman may also be interested in having some other fun with you along the way. Choose when to enjoy their attention and when not to as you fixate on your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467740/extras/1ccffc21e481d34540c17203cba12931.avif?t=1793816432\" width=620 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you will interact with the female swimmers and make decisions that will determine if you will get some steamy events or end up needing a cold shower. Do well enough and surely a place on the team is assured!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467740/extras/1383849f948b4ce19bd1646914acc537.avif?t=1793816432\" width=620 height=265 /></span></h2>",
            "short_description": "There's nothing better than swimming with a variety of women. Work hard and play hard with these beautiful swimmers to ensure the best of endings together as you compete for a place on the team.",
